Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves\Ncast, my heart adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor, ride as high as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're dashing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Water swirls, but I ain't backing\Ndown so long as I'm free, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd give it, come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You may look different, but you're\Nas impudent as ever. Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind and body have caught\Nup to your Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to reach a wakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a ridiculous transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked so hard to build this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you've taken so\Nmuch of it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My crew and my castle are in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And what have you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost some, but we'll take\Nway more back when I'm through!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Candle Dragon Swarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're having a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Every floor of the castle is on fire,\Nand it seems to be spreading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your crew and thousands\Nof soldiers are suffering inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon there'll be nothing but ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried at all. They're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I left that job to them, and\NI know my friends can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to focus on is\Nkicking your scaly ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stupid laugh is pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Demolition God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the towers are burning, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are we supposed to run now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Zoro, and Sanji, and Franky,\NBrook, Usopp, Robin, and Jinbe too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be in the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we put it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we find the rest of the crew,\Nthe entire island is one big inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where would we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless Onigashima lands,\Nwe're not safe anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zeus, can't you use your\Nrain to help put out the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I get burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We all worked really hard to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't end like this when we're\Nso close to winning. We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Luffy's gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cooking over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm slowly dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not hauling your corpse! Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's a way out, I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, come save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, my precious afro is\Ngetting even frizzier. This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll end\Nup looking like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,May your poor, tortured\Nsoul rest at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It breaks my heart just looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No one deserves to be such a cruel end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn to the bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This terrible fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear it'll take us all! Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a burnt corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am dead, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is becoming a bit\Noppressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear there may be no way out for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we can't get outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole yard is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,An endless abyss in front\Nand a hellish fire behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck and couldn't\Nturn back if we wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.30,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we're stuck in the air, surrounded\Nby fire with the island collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know it's hot, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the damn wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay in this spot\Nlong, we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to lose an arm than lose your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of those giant\Nmuscles if you're not gonna use them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running, but frankly,\NI don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A suggestion would be welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had any ideas, I'd tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll all suffocate to death at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no more I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack Green Star Sprinkler!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a word that comes to\Nmind, and that word is failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to keep my promise to Iso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to save Keen and Kiku,\Nand myself, of course, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.59,0:08:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely I'm worth saving, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This fire's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs to chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sora's not gonna make it at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get him to chop her\Nbefore he kicks the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something\Nabout the fire, we'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for! I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Will somebody save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope was so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Complaining ain't gonna do deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We promise we'll behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We hit another dead end. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not the fire,\Nthen it's the debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did somebody do this on\Npurpose to lock us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die in battle, I can accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure as hell not\Ngoing to burn to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fight is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn fire won't get the best of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Or me, we'll pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:10:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us proceed with the plan searching\Nbay with haste if you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for placing your faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not fail of course Luffy\Nformed an alliance with you samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never doubt your worth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, my trusted new ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us see this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been prepared for\Nthis since that accursed day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Omonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyoti!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, and make taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To my shame, I couldn't\Nsave Lord Odin that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I allowed Lord Momonosuke and the\Nothers to suffer in those flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the power of my\Nninjutsu, I still failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no greater regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That feeling of helplessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen rain like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how Zunesha takes a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Causing a mighty downpour\Nin the process, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My brave friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not let you perish in this fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I kept you waiting so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The water that I borrowed\Nfrom Zunesha's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall flow once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, ninpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrolling jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon the elephant's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ani-chi-ri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Restoration!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This certainly is a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Water art!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish and jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ocean Current Sildercrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your way through every hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The walkers of Zed shall\Ndeliver you from this hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to carry me like this are\Nyou kidding me this is the leaf we can do i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,know You're banged
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,up what should we do
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nowhere for us\Nto go what's that noise
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like something's coming
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to work Momonosuke! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is still alive, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be the one holding\Nup the island, not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So start making flame clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Support the entire island myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That is simply not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's wearing down. It won't hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wait, all of our allies might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:14:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've nearly won this, but\Nyou still must do your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.93,0:14:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the only choice\Nwe had from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To save Wano, you must protect Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make those flame clouds now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lose focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easier said than done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:14:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go along with\NKin'emon and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must travel 20 years into the\Nfuture and rebuild the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too much to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get you and Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, your mother is suffering\Nfar more from this than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the land of samurai where you\Nmust maintain honor or face death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This brave woman has\Ndisplayed unflinching resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A man cannot show cowardice\Nin the face of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be an unbearable shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin has left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So with all due respect, you are\Nno longer just an ordinary child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the sun and the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,of a distinguished Samanai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means you will be\NShogun of this country someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If the young Lord will not go,\Nthen I have one final request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,May we go forth to fight\Nour enemies once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, I will only burn to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me die like a Samanai,\Nfighting with sword in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us this mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us serve our fallen Lord,\Nas we have all vowed to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, live on, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can I show my face to mother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a mere child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not weak or useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the man who will become\NShogun of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save the land of\NWano and stop Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:17:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop, not go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Grabbing lightning\Nstraight from the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what an absurd power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boing, boing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:19:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this become a game to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then play around all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than a\NDevil Fruit to win this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wadju showed us the\Ntruth with his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He became king without a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,power to rely on because in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki trumps all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,destroyer of death
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,fadwa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To the ones we've lost, set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your sky boat fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The festival's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny. I'd almost\Nforgotten that I'm a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can survive another\Nyear to see this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Find my daddy up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your grubby hand off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making yourself an easy target!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Demolition bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you're still vulnerable!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To cutting attacks in your new form!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.80,0:23:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The nail came free!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.46,0:23:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That last tremor has released\Nme from this hellish prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.36,0:23:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't escape, I'll at\Nleast take you down with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:24:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you watching, Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.06,0:24:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter is at my mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,WE'RE GOING TO HELL TOGETHER!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things,\NOnigashima's about to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.26,0:24:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Kaido's starting\Nto lose. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we have two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you decide. If Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.22,0:24:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat beats Kaido, the\Nisland falls down and we all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Option two, we make it out alive\Nbecause Kaido survives the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.84,0:24:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that's easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.26,0:24:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a kid back in Hakumai\Nthat I'm fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm fighting for\Nmy wife back in Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaido gets his ass kicked, our\Nfamilies can live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.42,0:24:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a great country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone down there will\Nhave a bright future?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.72,0:25:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you samurai out of your damn minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.84,0:25:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be alive to enjoy it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.16,0:25:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's fine by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.76,0:25:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Make Kaido pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.82,0:25:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to win this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.28,0:25:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.04,0:25:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.08,0:25:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.02,0:25:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No fire to get the best of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.38,0:25:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.94,0:25:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.16,0:25:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku! Kill him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.90,0:26:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.20,0:26:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.20,0:26:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.60,0:26:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.51,0:26:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.70,0:26:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to wrap this fight up, but you've\Ngot to move that island out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.98,0:26:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This fist is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.16,0:26:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He could punch a hole straight\Nthrough Onigashima with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.31,0:26:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.23,0:26:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready yet! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.26,0:26:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:26:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you!
